  "description": "Count the number of arithmetic subsequences of length at least 3 in the given array.",
  "pseudocode": "1. let n = nums.length; let count = 0;\n2. let dp = new Array(n).fill(0).map(() => new Map());\n3. for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n4.   for (let j = 0; j < i; j++) {\n5.     let diff = nums[i] - nums[j];\n6.     let countAtJ = dp[j].get(diff) || 0;\n7.     count += countAtJ;\n8.     dp[i].set(diff, (dp[i].get(diff) || 0) + countAtJ + 1);\n9.   }\n10. }",
